  "description": "Enterprise Compliance Management Toolkit for DeepSeek Harness - GDPR/PIPL/等保/HIPAA/ISO compliance, contract scanning, policy monitoring, risk assessment, control testing, training management, whistleblower management, audit preparation, and privacy impact assessment",
  "type": "module",
